an class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ΚΟΙ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"καὶ\">καὶ\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"εἴ\">εἴ\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"τις\">τ[ις]\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"τολμήσει\">[τολμήσει]\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al5-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἀνῦξαι\">ἀνῦξ[αι\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: \u003Ca href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/Q2SBPG9F\">https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/Q2SBPG9F\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\">ΕΝΘΑ[..\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"κεῖται\">......\u003C/span>\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>ΞΕΝΑΠΟ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ΚΟΙ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cbr id=\"al4-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"καὶ\">ΚΑΙ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"εἴ\">ΕΙ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"τις\">Τ[..\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"τολμήσει\">........]\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al5-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἀνῦξαι\">ΑΝΥΞ[..\u003C/span>\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"facsimile-images\">\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>\u003Cspan>Text of Kaibel, after Amico\u003C/span>\u003C/span>; \u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"line 2\">line.2: \u003Cspan>ΞΕΝΑΠΟ[--- Amico, IG XIV 554; ξενι Πο[--- SGDI 5239; Ξεναό[ρας CIG IV 9513\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"lines 2-3\">lines.2-3: \u003Cspan>ἐ]|κοι[μήθη CIG IV 9513\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"line 4\">line.4: \u003Cspan>καὶ εἴ τ[ις τολμήσει CIG IV 9513, IG XIV 554; καὶ εἴ τ[ις Amico, SGDI 5239\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>Here lies … and whoever dares to open ...\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>Presumably line 2 preserves part of a personal name. The only record from autopsy would seem to be that of Amico. The funerary inscription opens with the traditional formula \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἐνθάδε κεῖται\u003C/span> (l. 1). Lines 4–5 contain a curse formula directed against anyone who might violate the tomb (for comparable examples from Catania, see IMusCatania 212 = \u003Ca href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000647\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000647\u003C/a>; for Christian curse formulas, see Feissel 1980, 464–470).\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Amico 1741 276 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Kirchhoff 1877 9513 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001250\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001250\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Kaibel 1890 \u003Ca href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">554\u003C/a>  \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Hoffmann 1904 5239 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000817\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000817\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Feissel 1980 464–470 \u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. \u003C/div>",[220,223,226,229,232,235],{"id":221,"html":222},"editions","\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: \u003Ca href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/Q2SBPG9F\">https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/Q2SBPG9F\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\">ἐνθά[δε]\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"κεῖται\">[κεῖται\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>ΞΕΝΑΠΟ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ΚΟΙ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"καὶ\">καὶ\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"εἴ\">εἴ\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"τις\">τ[ις]\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"τολμήσει\">[τολμήσει]\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al5-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἀνῦξαι\">ἀνῦξ[αι\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: \u003Ca href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/Q2SBPG9F\">https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/Q2SBPG9F\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\">ΕΝΘΑ[..\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"κεῖται\">......\u003C/span>\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>ΞΕΝΑΠΟ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ΚΟΙ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cbr id=\"al4-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"καὶ\">ΚΑΙ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"εἴ\">ΕΙ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"τις\">Τ[..\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"τολμήσει\">........]\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al5-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἀνῦξαι\">ΑΝΥΞ[..\u003C/span>\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>",{"id":224,"html":225},"apparatus","\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>\u003Cspan>Text of Kaibel, after Amico\u003C/span>\u003C/span>; \u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"line 2\">line.2: \u003Cspan>ΞΕΝΑΠΟ[--- Amico, IG XIV 554; ξενι Πο[--- SGDI 5239; Ξεναό[ρας CIG IV 9513\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"lines 2-3\">lines.2-3: \u003Cspan>ἐ]|κοι[μήθη CIG IV 9513\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"line 4\">line.4: \u003Cspan>καὶ εἴ τ[ις τολμήσει CIG IV 9513, IG XIV 554; καὶ εἴ τ[ις Amico, SGDI 5239\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>",{"id":227,"html":228},"translation","\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>Here lies … and whoever dares to open ...\u003C/p>  ",{"id":230,"html":231},"commentary","\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>Presumably line 2 preserves part of a personal name. The only record from autopsy would seem to be that of Amico. The funerary inscription opens with the traditional formula \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἐνθάδε κεῖται\u003C/span> (l. 1). Lines 4–5 contain a curse formula directed against anyone who might violate the tomb (for comparable examples from Catania, see IMusCatania 212 = \u003Ca href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000647\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000647\u003C/a>; for Christian curse formulas, see Feissel 1980, 464–470).\u003C/p>  ",{"id":233,"html":234},"bibliography","\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Amico 1741 276 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Kirchhoff 1877 9513 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001250\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001250\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Kaibel 1890 \u003Ca href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">554\u003C/a>  \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Hoffmann 1904 5239 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000817\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000817\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Feissel 1980 464–470 \u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  ",{"id":236,"html":237},"license"," Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. ",[239,241,244,245],{"html":240},"Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: \u003Ca href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/Q2SBPG9F\">https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/Q2SBPG9F\u003C/a>",{"id":242,"lang":110,"html":243},"edition-interpretive","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\">ἐνθά[δε]\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"κεῖται\">[κεῖται\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>ΞΕΝΑΠΟ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ΚΟΙ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"καὶ\">καὶ\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"εἴ\">εἴ\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"τις\">τ[ις]\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"τολμήσει\">[τολμήσει]\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al5-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἀνῦξαι\">ἀνῦξ[αι\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>",{"html":240},{"id":246,"lang":110,"html":247},"edition-diplomatic","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐνθάδε\">ΕΝΘΑ[..\u003C/span>\u0